{"header":{"numFound":2,"maxScore":1.0,"queryTime":35,"page":1,"pageSize":100},"results":[{"authors":[{"id":null,"fullName":"Bian, Dongfen","name":"Dongfen","surname":"Bian","rank":1,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Grenier, Emmanuel","name":"Emmanuel","surname":"Grenier","rank":2,"pid":null},{"id":"orcid_______::d950e56bf5cafe7c01235134141bd458","fullName":"Lafleche, Laurent","name":"Laurent","surname":"Lafleche","rank":3,"pid":{"id":{"scheme":"orcid","value":"0000-0002-5656-3019"},"provenance":null}},{"id":null,"fullName":"Nguyen, Quoc Hung","name":"Quoc Hung","surname":"Nguyen","rank":4,"pid":null}],"openAccessColor":null,"publiclyFunded":null,"eoscIfGuidelines":null,"type":"publication","language":{"code":"und","label":"Undetermined"},"countries":null,"subjects":[{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"semiclassical limit"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Hartree equation"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"81Q20 35Q83 35Q41"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Analysis of PDEs"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"FOS: Mathematics"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Vlasov–Poisson equation"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"[MATH.MATH-AP] Mathematics [math]/Analysis of PDEs [math.AP]"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"[MATH.MATH-MP] Mathematics [math]/Mathematical Physics [math-ph]"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Landau damping"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"[PHYS.QPHY] Physics [physics]/Quantum Physics [quant-ph]"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Analysis of PDEs (math.AP)"},"provenance":null}],"mainTitle":"Quantum Landau Damping with Coulomb Repulsion in the Whole Space","subTitle":null,"descriptions":["Dans cet article, nous étudions le comportement en temps long des solutions de l'équation de Hartree linéarisée au voisinage d'un équilibre stable spatialement homogène et nous examinons l'amortissement Landau quantique. Cela nous permet d'obtenir une décroissance temporelle du champ électrique, uniforme par rapport à la constante de Planck, ainsi que la convergence uniforme en temps de la densité quantique vers la densité classique lorsque la constante de Planck tend vers zéro.","In this paper, we study the large time behavior of solutions to the linearized Hartree equation near a stable equilibrium which is homogeneous in space and investigate the quantum Landau damping. This allows us to get time decay of the electric field, uniformly in the Planck constant, as well as the uniform-in-time convergence of the quantum density towards the classical density as the Planck constant converges to 0."],"publicationDate":"2026-01-01","publisher":"arXiv","embargoEndDate":"2026-09-01","sources":null,"formats":null,"contributors":["Lafleche, Laurent"],"coverages":null,"bestAccessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/"},"container":null,"documentationUrls":null,"codeRepositoryUrl":null,"programmingLanguage":null,"contactPeople":null,"contactGroups":null,"tools":null,"size":null,"version":null,"geoLocations":null,"id":"doi_dedup___::a754b0110ba71c8b66213f0f0aaf3c06","originalIds":["50|datacite____::a754b0110ba71c8b66213f0f0aaf3c06","10.48550/arxiv.2609.02040","50|od________18::66065a367a743210b17f8b9c9d8ba580","oai:arXiv.org:2609.02040","oai:HAL:hal-05737651v1","50|od_______166::b13e80ae4e7d91d4aa6986f0628a92e2"],"pids":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.48550/arxiv.2609.02040"},{"scheme":"arXiv","value":"2609.02040"}],"dateOfCollection":null,"lastUpdateTimeStamp":null,"indicators":{"citationImpact":{"citationCount":0.0,"influence":2.1323419E-9,"popularity":2.5059315E-9,"impulse":0.0,"citationClass":"C5","influenceClass":"C5","impulseClass":"C5","popularityClass":"C5"}},"projects":null,"organizations"